{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And He sent His arrows</b> — The word רב is a past-tense verb from the doubled stems [binyanim of hif'il pattern], on the pattern of כי אם תם הכסף. And it is from the root of ורובו. And behold, רב corresponds to וישלח."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The phrase 'מפעלי הכפל על משקל' is cryptic; read literally. The citation 'כי אם תם הכסף' (from Genesis 23:16) serves as a morphological parallel for a doubly final-root verb. The logic connecting these forms is compressed and left as-is."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:35.706123021Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}